Oracle Interview Questions — Round 1 & 2 🚀
#OracleInterview

After sharing my Oracle interview journey earlier, I received a lot of messages asking for the actual technical questions that were asked so here are all the questions from Round 1 & Round 2 👇

Round 1 – Screening / Coding Round (on HackerRank)

Q1 – Bash Script
Suppose you have a folder where multiple files are stored.
Write a bash script to check each file and show the highest file size with file name.
Q2 – Jenkins CI/CD Pipeline
Write a Jenkins CI/CD pipeline that you are using in your current project
from code checkout, build, test, deploy, and at last, show the success or failure of the pipeline, and perform cleanup.
Q3 – Kubernetes Manifest
Write a Kubernetes manifest file that uses both Liveness and Readiness probes for health checks.

Round 2 – Technical + Coding + DevOps/SRE Discussion (1 hour 20 mins)
Python
Suppose in a class, many students are appearing for an exam with 5 subjects.  Write a Python script to find the highest marks in each subject along with the student’s name.

Jenkins
How can you run your Jenkins pipeline jobs in parallel?
Jenkins pipelines need to trigger across multi-cloud environments, how would you design this?
How would you implement compliance checks in Jenkins pipelines?
How do you handle cross-region or multi-datacenter deployments using Jenkins?

Kubernetes
How do you ensure deployments roll back automatically if new pods fail?
You need to replicate Kubernetes secrets across multiple clusters, how do you manage this securely?
What’s the difference between ImagePullBackOff and CrashLoopBackOff errors? How do you troubleshoot them?
In a large cluster with hundreds of microservices, how do you ensure observability and control for service-to-service communication?

Docker
Write a Docker Compose file and explain it line by line.
How would you securely expose a containerized API over HTTPS?
How would you ensure all Docker images are scanned for vulnerabilities before deployment?
How do you handle data migration when upgrading containerized databases?

Terraform
How do you secure Terraform state that contains sensitive data?
You need to migrate 100+ existing resources into Terraform, how do you plan this?
How do you design multi-cloud DR using Terraform?
Your Terraform apply is slow due to thousands of resources, how do you optimize it?
Your Terraform apply succeeded, but some resources aren’t behaving as expected, how do you debug this?

SRE Concepts
What do you understand by SRE and explain SLOs, SLIs, and SLAs and also explain error budget.
How do you perform a postmortem after resolving an incident?
How do you handle a P1 incident? Explain your end-to-end steps.
